## Session Status

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `ACTIVE` | Valid and usable |
| `EXPIRED` | Past expiry time |
| `REVOKED` | Manually invalidated |
| `REFRESHED` | Superseded by a new session after token rotation |

